<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures higher, S&amp;Ps extend gains.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures higher, S&amp;Ps extend gains.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 18 - U.S. stock index futures were higher, with S&amp;P 500s extending gains in light trade. Traders said June S&amp;Ps' rally to 773.00 was expiration-related. April options on stock index futures expire at the close. Strong resistance rests at 774.00 to 774.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/)) E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
